    "description": "At 256 PM EDT, Doppler radar was tracking a strong thunderstorm over\nCarloover, or near Clifton Forge, moving southeast at 20 mph.\n\nHAZARD...Wind gusts up to 40 mph.\n\nSOURCE...Radar indicated.\n\nIMPACT...Gusty winds could knock down tree limbs and blow around\nunsecured objects.\n\nLocations impacted include...\nClifton Forge...\nIron Gate...\nDouthat State Park...\nLow Moor...\nIngalls Field...\nCarloover...\nand Natural Well.",
